  "ruleText": "Plc 1607.02 Procedures for Disciplinary and Non-Disciplinary Remedial Proceedings and Imposing License Conditions. The procedures in Plc 311 shall govern disciplinary and non-disciplinary remedial proceedings and imposing license conditions.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
